### 변수
@host = http://localhost:9876

### 1. 회귀 - 일반 URL 단축
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.google.com"
}

> {%
client.global.set("plainKey", response.body.shortKey);
 %}

### 2. 회귀 - 단축 URL 리다이렉트 (302 -> google)
# @no-redirect
GET {{host}}/{{plainKey}}

### 3. 검증 차단 - 과거 expiresAt (예상: 400)
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.naver.com",
  "expiresAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00"
}

### 4. 검증 차단 - 너무 짧은 비번 (예상: 400)
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.naver.com",
  "password": "12"
}

### 5. 비번 보호 URL 생성 (예상: 201)
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.naver.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
client.global.set("protectedKey", response.body.shortKey);
 %}

### 6. 비번 URL GET - 비번 안 보냄 (예상: 401 PasswordRequired)
# @no-redirect
GET {{host}}/{{protectedKey}}

### 7. 비번 URL POST - 틀린 비번 (예상: PasswordMismatch)
# @no-redirect
POST {{host}}/{{protectedKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "wrong123"
}

### 8. 비번 URL POST - 맞는 비번 (예상: 302 -> naver)
# @no-redirect
POST {{host}}/{{protectedKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password123"
}